# A run directory holds screenshots, the conversation, the server's save and logs.
# Git keeps only the small files that describe a run and its outcome.
runs/**
!runs/**/
!runs/**/config.json
!runs/**/summary.json
!runs/**/milestones.json
!runs/**/log.jsonl
!runs/**/console.log
!runs/**/handbook*.md
!runs/**/overview.mp4
!runs/**/screens.mp4
!runs/**/prices.json
!runs/README.md
!runs/ledger.jsonl
# Throwaway runs made while checking the harness
runs/shakedown/
